  "description": "In an era where discrimination against male Omegas is rampant, high school student Han Je-hui manifests as an Alpha because of his feelings for his teacher, Song Su-hyeon, who has been hiding his identity by passing himself off as a Beta. Even after becoming a college student, Je-hui is unable to forget Su-hyeon and secretly stalks him, until he eventually comes face-to-face with Su-hyeon just as his heat begins...\n\n_“Teacher, you were an Omega?”_\n\n_Source: BOMTOON, translated_",
